        "Equate $2x^2 + kx + k - 1 = 2x + 3 \\implies 2x^2 + (k - 2)x + (k - 4) = 0$.",
        "Set discriminant $\\Delta = (k - 2)^2 - 8(k - 4) = 0$ and solve for $k$."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "Equate the curve and tangent equations:\n$$2x^2 + kx + k - 1 = 2x + 3 \\implies 2x^2 + (k - 2)x + (k - 4) = 0$$",
